{"id":"loteri_a","lemma":"lotería","pos":"noun","rank":2987,"glosses":["lottery","a traditional Mexican game of chance, similar to bingo, but using images on a deck of cards instead of numbered ping pong balls"],"ipa":"/loteˈɾia/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"loterías"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-loter%C3%ADa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella ganó la lotería.","en":"She won the lottery.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Me gané la lotería.","en":"I won the lottery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444387","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Gané una cámara en la lotería.","en":"I won a camera in the lottery.","words":[{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"room"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Si me toca la lotería, dejaré de trabajar.","en":"If I win the lottery, I'll stop working.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300491","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"kerchief, turban cloth"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to work"}]},{"text":"Ellos se ganaron la lotería.","en":"They won the lottery.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}